            "kind": 1,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "〈美股早盤〉非農太強推升Fed升息預期 主要指數漲跌互現",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"〈美股早盤〉非農太強推升Fed升息預期 主要指數漲跌互現\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"541\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/5731b3bedd7cb2179497f3462930b02bc56d2f618a324224d08bcf60427139a1/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fca%2Fcnyes_hk_559%2Fcc33c9b7428ecdd674602e1a3dea1225.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">〈美股早盤〉非農太強推升Fed升息預期 主要指數漲跌互現</figcaption></div></figure></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E7%BE%8E%E8%82%A1%E6%97%A9%E7%9B%A4-%E9%9D%9E%E8%BE%B2%E5%A4%AA%E5%BC%B7%E6%8E%A8%E5%8D%87fed%E5%8D%87%E6%81%AF%E9%A0%90%E6%9C%9F-%E4%B8%BB%E8%A6%81%E6%8C%87%E6%95%B8%E6%BC%B2%E8%B7%8C%E4%BA%92%E7%8F%BE-134225187.html",
