        {
            "title": "強勁就業數據打壓市場情緒，金礦股與比特幣概念股齊跌",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"強勁就業數據打壓市場情緒，金礦股與比特幣概念股齊跌\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"540\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/045f62117b658d7e3f89c0d2a392ab008038342c1e6405ef79e08816e80c67a2/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fcontent-media.investing.com%2Fnews%2FLYNXMPEABU081_M.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">強勁就業數據打壓市場情緒，金礦股與比特幣概念股齊跌</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Investing.com - 周五，受美國強勁就業報告衝擊，市場對聯準會貨幣寬鬆的預期大幅降溫，金礦股與加密貨幣相關股票普遍下挫。聯準會下周升息的隱含概率從52%躍升至60%。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">美國勞工部公布，上月非農就業人數大增16.2萬，遠超市場預期的5.5萬，令市場大感意外。強韌的勞動市場釋出經濟穩健信號，聯邦基金期貨市場隨即重新定價政策預期，交易員目前預計聯準會下周會議升息的概率已升至60%，高於數據公布前的52%。不過，市場人士強調，下周公布的消費者物價指數（CPI）數據，才是官員開會前最關鍵的決定性因素。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-6916ce80-a69e-3551-af8f-5f3a7d5dd8da-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">持續走高或維持高位的殖利率前景令無息資產承壓，金價與比特幣雙雙走低，相關股票亦隨之同步下跌。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[92px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[92px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">金礦股全面下挫</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">主要金礦生產商普遍遭到拋售，包括巴里克黃金（NYSE:B）、紐蒙特公司（NYSE:NEM）、阿格尼科鷹礦業（NYSE:AEM）、金羅斯黃金（NYSE:KGC）、皇家黃金（NASDAQ:RGLD）及金田公司（NYSE:GFI）。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">加密貨幣及礦企股同步回落</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">數字資產相關股票同樣面臨沉重賣壓。比特幣國庫持有者MicroStrategy（NASDAQ:MSTR）與American Bitcoin Corp（NASDAQ:ABTC）雙雙下跌，數字資產平台Coinbase Global（NASDAQ:COIN）、Galaxy Digital（NASDAQ:GLXY）及必金區塊鏈音譯(HK)（Bgin Blockchain Inc，NASDAQ:BGIN）亦告下挫。Circle Internet（NYSE:CRCL）與Robinhood Markets（NASDAQ:HOOD）同樣錄得跌幅。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">純比特幣礦企股跌幅尤為顯著，MARA Holdings（NASDAQ:MARA）、Riot Platforms（NASDAQ:RIOT）、CleanSpark（NASDAQ:CLSK）、Core Scientific（NASDAQ:CORZ）、Hut 8（NASDAQ:HUT）、Cipher Mining（NASDAQ:CIFR）、IREN Ltd（NASDAQ:IREN）及比特小鹿科技集團（Bitdeer Technologies Group，NASDAQ:BTDR）均出現不同程度的損失。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">強勁的就業數據通常會強化聯準會收緊貨幣政策的理由，推升實際殖利率，進而提高持有黃金、加密貨幣等無息資產的機會成本，對此類資產構成壓力。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><em>此文章由人工智能協助翻譯。更多資訊，請參閱我們的使用條款。</em></p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E5%BC%B7%E5%8B%81%E5%B0%B1%E6%A5%AD%E6%95%B8%E6%93%9A%E6%89%93%E5%A3%93%E5%B8%82%E5%A0%B4%E6%83%85%E7%B7%92-%E9%87%91%E7%A4%A6%E8%82%A1%E8%88%87%E6%AF%94%E7%89%B9%E5%B9%A3%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5%E8%82%A1%E9%BD%8A%E8%B7%8C-141119642.html",
            "pub_date": "2026-09-04 22:52:43",
