期中最耀眼的<strong>出場案例</strong>。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><strong>已是會員？</strong>立即前往查看<strong>9月完整選股名單</strong>，請點擊<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"此處\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:此處;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://ph.investing.com/pro/pricing?paywall=propicks?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">此處</a>。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">尚未成為會員？立即把握機會，獲取完整名單：</p><ul class=\"mb-module-gap\"><li class=\"ml-4 list-disc\"><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"App用戶可在此訂閱\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:App用戶可在此訂閱;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://ph.investing.com/apps/?screen=pro_lp?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>App用戶可在此訂閱</strong></a></p></li><li class=\"ml-4 list-disc\"><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"網頁用戶可在此訂閱\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:網頁用戶可在此訂閱;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://ph.investing.com/pro/pricing?paywall=propicks?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>網頁用戶可在此訂閱</strong></a></p></li></ul><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><em>此文章由人工智能協助翻譯。